# Generated register dumps and resaved test artifacts (make verify)
tests/dumps/

# Locally built binaries
tools/bin/
tools/gt2-refdump/gt2dump
gt2-src/**/*.o
gt2-src/goattrk2

# Generated driver binary (rebuild with `make driver`)
exporters/gt2/build/gt2_driver.prg
.DS_Store
hvsc-cache/

# Third-party SID tunes are their composers' copyrighted work - never commit
# them. Tunes are fetched from HVSC on demand via the /hvsc/ proxy
# (tools/serve.py) into hvsc-cache/ above. Songs authored HERE live as .sng
# (sids/default-song.sng), which is deliberately still tracked.
sids/*.sid

# The C64 Pro Mono webfont is Style's work (https://style64.org/c64-truetype).
# Their license explicitly ALLOWS embedding it via @font-face "for display on
# any web site", unmodified and under its original filenames - which is what
# style.css does. What it forbids is providing the files "for direct download
# from any website", and a public repo is exactly that: raw.githubusercontent
# serves the file, and so does every source ZIP. So it cannot be committed
# here, however much it belongs to the design.
#
# Every font-family falls back to plain monospace when it is absent, so a
# fresh clone and the deployed site both work - they just look generic. To get
# the real thing locally, download C64 TrueType v1.2.1/Style yourself from the
# link above and drop the .woff/.woff2 in here under their own filenames.
fonts/

# Pages build output (tools/build-pages.mjs)
_site/
